<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Item 8.01. Other Events.</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">On August 27, 2026, Raphael Zagury, the Chief Executive Officer of
Twenty One Capital, Inc. (the &#8220;Company&#8221;), presented in the Bitcoin Asia 2026 conference regarding the Bitcoin mining industry.
A copy of the presentation and a transcript of the presentation are attached as Exhibits 99.1 and 99.2 to this Current Report on Form
8-K and is incorporated herein by reference.</p>

